<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 22/23.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 22/23.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Tuesday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for July 23. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   21.07.97	  18.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6900	    6.7122</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2152	    2.2330</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.3774	    4.4050</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4347	    3.4587</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5127	    0.5148</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7507	    0.7556</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2768	    0.2791</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9282	    6.9499</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6906	    0.6911</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1539	    1.1451</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
